# What `dart pub publish` / `dn plugin publish` leave out of the package tarball.
#
# When this file exists pub uses it INSTEAD of .gitignore for this directory, so
# everything .gitignore excludes is repeated here, followed by things that belong
# in the repository but not in the published package.

# --- mirrored from .gitignore ---
*.class
*.log
*.pyc
*.swp
.DS_Store
.atom/
.build/
.buildlog/
.history
.svn/
.swiftpm/
migrate_working_dir/
*.iml
*.ipr
*.iws
.idea/
.vscode/
/pubspec.lock
/pubspec_overrides.yaml
**/doc/api/
.dart_tool/
.flutter-plugins-dependencies
.dn-plugins-dependencies
/build/
/coverage/
# `dn plugin build` output. The artifact is published with `dn plugin publish`,
# never carried inside the Dart package — it is tens of megabytes of .aar and
# xcframework.
/dist/

# --- repository-only ---
# The research log behind doc/design.md. Contributor material, like CLAUDE.md:
# it records how the design was arrived at, not how to use the package. The
# design spec itself stays in — the public API's doc comments cite its sections.
doc/research.md
# Agent guidance for people working ON this package. Consumers get the
# package's own skill from `skills/` via `dart run skills@ get`; the contents of
# .claude/skills/ are mostly third-party skills vendored under their own
# licences, which should not be redistributed inside this package.
.claude/
.config/
CLAUDE.md
